I'm sorry...

262
00:16:03,240 --> 00:16:05,480
I can't find her!

263
00:16:08,100 --> 00:16:09,260
Is everybody ready?

264
00:16:10,840 --> 00:16:12,660
Let's go, Lurch!

265
00:16:13,600 --> 00:16:14,430
Faster!

266
00:16:15,060 --> 00:16:15,890
Whoa!

267
00:16:18,800 --> 00:16:19,630
Oh!

268
00:16:20,540 --> 00:16:22,960
Oh, you're so relentless, senor.

269
00:16:25,360 --> 00:16:26,720
Almost there.

270
00:16:27,920 --> 00:16:28,860
Huh?

271
00:16:30,440 --> 00:16:31,840
Franky Ear.

272
00:16:32,100 --> 00:16:35,597
Unlike the rest of his body, his
ears have no mechanical advantage.

273
00:16:35,680 --> 00:16:40,817
However, his hearing is naturally
quite good, so he gets along just fine.

274
00:16:40,900 --> 00:16:41,960
Listen,

275
00:16:42,580 --> 00:16:44,877
Something's been bugging me, hmm.

276
00:16:44,960 --> 00:16:49,877
It's not the kind of thing you'd
care about, I guess, but uh,

277
00:16:49,960 --> 00:16:55,297
earlier I saw this sweet old granny having

278
00:16:55,380 --> 00:16:57,237
a tough time on that street over there,

279
00:16:57,320 --> 00:16:59,297
and it darn near broke my heart.

280
00:16:59,380 --> 00:17:04,737
Is that so?

281
00:17:04,820 --> 00:17:07,100
You sure hate to see that?

282
00:17:12,340 --> 00:17:15,460
Not so fast, little shrimps.

283
00:17:19,460 --> 00:17:22,217
You think I'm gonna let you out better?

284
00:17:22,300 --> 00:17:24,594
Remember who's in charge of this place.

285
00:17:26,420 --> 00:17:27,250
That's the manager.

286
00:17:27,333 --> 00:17:28,771
We're in big trouble now.

287
00:17:29,840 --> 00:17:30,670
Pathetic!

288
00:17:30,753 --> 00:17:32,997
You twerps have been
here all this time and

289
00:17:33,080 --> 00:17:35,517
you just now realized
you're nothing but slaves?

290
00:17:35,600 --> 00:17:37,057
I'll put you back to work!

291
00:17:37,140 --> 00:17:38,340
Break time is over!

292
00:17:38,460 --> 00:17:39,519
Don't be layabout!

293
00:17:42,040 --> 00:17:42,920
Come here!

294
00:17:44,380 --> 00:17:47,257
If we don't come up with
something quick, we're finished!

295
00:17:47,340 --> 00:17:48,417
Open the door!

296
00:17:48,500 --> 00:17:49,735
That's our only hope!

297
00:18:05,680 --> 00:18:07,840
Nice work, now let's party!

298
00:18:09,480 --> 00:18:10,960
It's a robot!

299
00:18:11,640 --> 00:18:15,260
A big strong robot game to save us!

300
00:18:15,500 --> 00:18:16,420
Thank you, sir!

301
00:18:16,860 --> 00:18:17,700
So cool!

302
00:18:17,860 --> 00:18:19,213
The robots are awesome!

303
00:18:19,400 --> 00:18:21,420
Is everybody okay? Yeah!

304
00:18:21,680 --> 00:18:22,880
We made it!

305
00:18:23,060 --> 00:18:25,413
We're breaking all you guys out of here!

306
00:18:33,780 --> 00:18:35,400
I'm so happy.

307
00:18:35,700 --> 00:18:38,180
Good for you. Thank you, Mr. Robot.

308
00:18:38,540 --> 00:18:40,599
He has a name and he's not a robot.

309
00:18:40,920 --> 00:18:43,979
He's a big person, the great
hero known as Frawland.

310
00:18:46,540 --> 00:18:49,340
What kind of person is
this princess of yours?

311
00:18:49,640 --> 00:18:51,537
Hmm, where does that...

312
00:18:51,620 --> 00:18:53,257
Don't ignore me!

313
00:18:53,340 --> 00:18:57,400
We never settle things between
us, you bunch of little dolts!

314
00:18:59,260 --> 00:19:01,780
The factory is my life!

315
00:19:02,040 --> 00:19:03,860
I'm the manager, you punks!

316
00:19:04,060 --> 00:19:07,472
When they call me to the scene,
you know you're in for it!

317
00:19:14,960 --> 00:19:18,457
You're Cyborg Franky from the
Straw Hat Pirates, aren't you?

318
00:19:18,540 --> 00:19:20,517
I thought you only had a one-star bounty!

319
00:19:20,600 --> 00:19:23,894
How did you make it this far
with a target on your head?

320
00:19:24,040 --> 00:19:27,520
Senor Pink should have
stopped you. Yeah? You think?

321
00:19:28,040 --> 00:19:29,697
Anyway, this is my factory.

322
00:19:29,780 --> 00:19:31,997
I won't let you have the run of the place.

323
00:19:32,080 --> 00:19:34,220
You step up to this lady, you die!

324
00:19:34,820 --> 00:19:37,060
Frolin, be careful. She's strong.

325
00:19:44,400 --> 00:19:47,640
Frolin gave the man Julie a great big hug!

326
00:19:49,220 --> 00:19:51,240
Hey, what's the big idea here?

327
00:19:51,380 --> 00:19:53,080
You're being weird. Let go!

328
00:19:53,360 --> 00:19:55,066
Valen just keeps hugging her.

329
00:19:56,440 --> 00:19:57,620
Bastard fooled me.

330
00:19:57,920 --> 00:20:00,160
That dirty, lying cyborg.

331
00:20:00,420 --> 00:20:04,008
I was all worried about that
granny, but she isn't even real.

332
00:20:05,800 --> 00:20:08,057
Well, at least I don't have to worry now.

333
00:20:08,140 --> 00:20:10,240
Oh, so are Niles!

334
00:20:11,040 --> 00:20:12,360
Hey, Senor Pink.

335
00:20:12,620 --> 00:20:14,440
I'm ready to go again anytime.

336
00:20:14,960 --> 00:20:15,790
Bring it on, bro.

337
00:20:15,873 --> 00:20:20,700
This is not appropriate behavior for a
workplace environment, okay? You know,

338
00:20:20,900 --> 00:20:25,177
that big baby has been rattling my head
with suplexes one after another all day.

339
00:20:25,260 --> 00:20:26,090
Huh?

340
00:20:26,173 --> 00:20:27,003
What's the deal?

341
00:20:27,220 --> 00:20:32,044
Maybe he thought my head was a jackhammer
and he was trying to dig himself a hole.

342
00:20:32,420 --> 00:20:34,337
You've really lost it, haven't you?

343
00:20:34,420 --> 00:20:35,740
I'm taking you out.

344
00:20:35,980 --> 00:20:37,660
Cat Ear Punch!

345
00:20:38,540 --> 00:20:41,120
The Ranky Southland Suplex!

346
00:21:05,860 --> 00:21:08,200
Uh-oh, she's really mad, uh-oh.

347
00:21:08,320 --> 00:21:09,732
That hurts, you bastard!

348
00:21:09,940 --> 00:21:12,857
Didn't your mama ever tell you
that's no way to treat a lady?

349
00:21:12,940 --> 00:21:14,757
You think you can get away with that?

350
00:21:14,840 --> 00:21:15,670
What?

351
00:21:15,753 --> 00:21:16,583
In my factory?

352
00:21:16,666 --> 00:21:17,695
I'm the manager here!

353
00:21:17,800 --> 00:21:19,565
That means nobody is above me!

354
00:21:19,680 --> 00:21:21,197
I don't care how nice your hugs are.

355
00:21:21,280 --> 00:21:24,017
Once she gets this mad,
there's no stopping her.

356
00:21:24,100 --> 00:21:25,280
Run away, Froland!

357
00:21:25,860 --> 00:21:28,957
I'm gonna cut you into tiny pieces,
then suck them up with my vacuum,

358
00:21:29,040 --> 00:21:30,457
then dump them out and stomp on them!

359
00:21:30,540 --> 00:21:32,217
then suck them up all over again!

360
00:21:32,300 --> 00:21:35,124
So start crying, not that
it'll do you any good!

361
00:21:38,100 --> 00:21:41,200
Froland gave the manager a great big kiss!

362
00:21:55,360 --> 00:21:57,117
My, how daring!

363
00:21:57,200 --> 00:22:00,320
He stole a kiss from these sweet lips!

364
00:22:03,940 --> 00:22:06,234
You gonna lay there and drown, or what?

365
00:22:06,360 --> 00:22:07,500
Hold on, Franky!

366
00:22:07,860 --> 00:22:08,900
What was that?

367
00:22:09,120 --> 00:22:11,437
I didn't know you felt that way about me!

368
00:22:11,520 --> 00:22:13,200
Everything's moving so fast!

369
00:22:13,760 --> 00:22:18,360
If that's how you feel about a girl,
then you should ask her out first, dummy!

370
00:22:19,740 --> 00:22:21,737
I never knew she had a girly side.

371
00:22:21,820 --> 00:22:22,820
This is a shock.

372
00:22:24,040 --> 00:22:25,981
It ain't his fault, Miss Manager.

373
00:22:26,300 --> 00:22:27,980
That's how it goes. Huh?

374
00:22:28,560 --> 00:22:30,620
Love's got nothing to do with it.

375
00:22:30,760 --> 00:22:32,231
Even though he kissed me?

376
00:22:32,720 --> 00:22:36,737
That's right, because you caught him
during a sacred fight between two men.

377
00:22:36,820 --> 00:22:42,340
He had to seal those lips somehow, and
a smooch is the easiest way to do it.

378
00:22:43,600 --> 00:22:46,117
One little kiss ain't no thing, sister.

379
00:22:46,200 --> 00:22:49,577
This is a battlefield, not
some daycare playground.

380
00:22:49,660 --> 00:22:52,797
You think I'm looking for
romance in a time like this?

381
00:22:52,880 --> 00:22:54,460
You said it.

382
00:22:55,500 --> 00:22:57,417
Who needs baby love?

383
00:22:57,500 --> 00:23:01,060
We're living in a man's world.

384
00:23:06,480 --> 00:23:08,820
They're so hard-boiled!

385
00:23:09,940 --> 00:23:11,920
Franky! Senor!

386
00:23:12,340 --> 00:23:14,820
You're the perfect hard-boiled duo!

387
00:23:15,400 --> 00:23:18,480
I'm not gonna let you
wreck this factory, robot.

388
00:23:19,100 --> 00:23:22,460
Then prove it with your
fists, if you're a man!

389
00:23:22,800 --> 00:23:23,860
I'm almost scared.

390
00:23:24,060 --> 00:23:25,840
It's gonna get so manly!

391
00:23:28,420 --> 00:23:29,840
Diaper bombs!

392
00:23:32,600 --> 00:23:34,220
Nipple Light Special!

393
00:23:40,040 --> 00:23:42,840
Would you stop turning
into rocks and fight me?

394
00:23:46,740 --> 00:23:49,700
I almost had them and now
Rebecca's getting away!

395
00:23:50,680 --> 00:23:51,557
Yeah, thanks, pal.

396
00:23:51,640 --> 00:23:53,317
Couldn't have done it without you.

397
00:23:53,400 --> 00:23:56,500
You and your friends are
gonna die in this cage!

398
00:23:57,740 --> 00:24:00,057
There could be enemies
waiting on the second level.

399
00:24:00,140 --> 00:24:02,199
Let's be careful where we jump off.

400
00:24:06,400 --> 00:24:07,680
Hello, Leo here.

401
00:24:07,860 --> 00:24:08,860
This is Mouji.

402
00:24:09,080 --> 00:24:10,460
Oh, good, you're free.

403
00:24:10,760 --> 00:24:13,137
I guess that means
everyone else is too then?

404
00:24:13,220 --> 00:24:15,860
Indeed we are, but I have some awful news.

405
00:24:16,020 --> 00:24:17,520
Whoa, what is it, Mouji?

406
00:24:17,900 --> 00:24:20,720
The princess, Princess Moucherie.

407
00:24:21,120 --> 00:24:23,120
It seems she isn't at the factory.

408
00:24:23,880 --> 00:24:27,800
The poor little dear, she must
be locked up somewhere awful,

409
00:24:28,060 --> 00:24:30,340
calling my name again and again!

410
00:24:31,160 --> 00:24:32,880
What should we do?

411
00:24:33,420 --> 00:24:35,480
March to the old king's plateau!

412
00:24:39,000 --> 00:24:41,540
Surround King Rick and God Usopp!

413
00:24:42,160 --> 00:24:44,101
Nothing to be scared of just yet.

414
00:24:44,200 --> 00:24:45,317
We're in a good spot.

415
00:24:45,400 --> 00:24:47,917
Who knows if they can
even climb up this high.

416
00:24:48,000 --> 00:24:50,540
Find God Usopp and string him up!

417
00:24:52,100 --> 00:24:53,200
I have good news!

418
00:24:53,480 --> 00:24:55,337
All the Tontaras have been set free!

419
00:24:55,420 --> 00:24:57,420
Oh? At the factory? Yes.

420
00:24:58,560 --> 00:25:01,560
But, they said they can't
find Princess Mon Cherie.

421
00:25:01,920 --> 00:25:02,980
She's not there?

422
00:25:03,280 --> 00:25:04,957
None of that matters right now!

423
00:25:05,040 --> 00:25:07,337
Everyone in the whole
kingdom is trying to kill us!

424
00:25:07,420 --> 00:25:08,680
We need to run away!

425
00:25:09,100 --> 00:25:13,688
If everyone in the whole kingdom is after
us, then there's nowhere safe to go.

426
00:25:15,060 --> 00:25:15,890
It's fine.

427
00:25:16,340 --> 00:25:19,637
Now they all know the truth
about what happened in the past.

428
00:25:19,720 --> 00:25:21,197
The people won't harm father.

429
00:25:21,280 --> 00:25:22,257
I'm certain of that.

430
00:25:22,340 --> 00:25:25,000
What about me? Viola. Yes? Hello?

431
00:25:25,440 --> 00:25:30,087
If they're hiding Princess Monchery, she
must be somewhere in the royal palace.

432
00:25:30,400 --> 00:25:32,040
She must be well hidden.

433
00:25:32,740 --> 00:25:34,446
Search every nook and cranny.

434
00:25:34,780 --> 00:25:38,133
The flamingo wouldn't be
foolish enough to kill Monchery.

435
00:25:38,680 --> 00:25:41,800
Her ability is far too
valuable for him to lose.

436
00:25:43,580 --> 00:25:47,620
Frankly, we could use that
ability ourselves at the moment.

437
00:26:04,660 --> 00:26:05,620
Take it.

438
00:26:05,760 --> 00:26:06,620
Time to eat.

439
00:26:11,500 --> 00:26:14,597
I just want to go back to Green Bed.

440
00:26:14,680 --> 00:26:18,540
Won't anybody come save me?

441
00:26:23,480 --> 00:26:24,620
Leo!
